tensors", "wan", "default"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 20, "type": "CLIPLoader", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "models": [{"name": "umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors", "directory": "text_encoders", "url": "https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors?download=true"}], "ver": "0.3.44", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPLoader"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "joycaption_beta1_model", "links": [172], "label": "joycaption_beta1_model", "type": "JOYCAPTIONBETA1_MODEL", "localized_name": "joycaption_beta1_model"}], "size": [453.6000061035156, 106], "color": "rgba(38, 73, 116, 0.7)", "pos": [410, 1140], "widgets_values": ["fancyfeast/llama-joycaption-beta-one-hf-llava", "nf4", "cuda"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 116, "type": "LayerUtility: LoadJoyCaptionBeta1Model", "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI_LayerStyle_Advance", "ver": "0f9184100e626e3202568a7cf890b3b92685a168", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LayerUtility: LoadJoyCaptionBeta1Model"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [170], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [390, 355], "pos": [410, 730], "widgets_values": ["auto", "english", false, "", "", "GoogleTranslator", "你是一位顶级的人物姿态分析师 (Human Pose Analyst)。你的任务是根据提供的图像，深入分析图中人物的身体动作、姿态、重心、肢体位置、与环境的互动以及可能的运动状态，并生成一段能够极其精准且详细地传达人物姿态的英文提示词。此助手输出的全部内容都将聚焦于人物姿态，不涉及其他图像元素。\n核心任务与分析框架 (Core Task & Analysis Framework)\n你的分析和最终的描述，需要将以下四点核心要素详细且无歧义地融合在一起：\n身体朝向与视角 (Body Orientation & View)：描述人物的整体身体是面向哪个方向，以及镜头是如何捕捉这个方向的。\n身体朝向: front view (正面), back view (背面), side view (侧面, 需指明左右，如 left side view, right side view), three-quarter view (四分之三侧面, 需指明哪边侧，如 front three-quarter view, back three-quarter view).\n头部朝向: head facing forward (头面向前方), head turned left/right (头转向左/右), looking over shoulder (回眸), looking down (低头), looking up (抬头).\n视线方向: gazing at viewer (凝视观者), gazing into distance (凝视远方), eyes closed (闭眼).\n身体状态与重心 (Body State & Balance)：描述人物是处于静态还是动态，以及身体重心的分配。\n静态: standing still (静止站立), sitting calmly (平静坐着), lying down (躺着), kneeling (跪着), crouching (蹲着), leaning against [surface] (倚靠某物).\n动态: walking (行走), running (跑步), jumping (跳跃), dancing (跳舞), stretching (伸展), bending over (弯腰), twisting body (扭动身体), mid-stride (行进中).\n重心: balanced stance (平衡姿态), weight shifted to left/right leg (重心移至左/右腿), leaning forward/backward (前倾/后仰).\n肢体位置与手势 (Limb Placement & Gestures)：详细描述四肢（手臂、腿部）的具体位置和手的姿态。\n手臂位置: arms at side (手臂在身体两侧), arms folded (抱臂), arms raised (手臂抬起), hands on hips (双手叉腰), arms extended forward/sideways/up (手臂前伸/侧伸/上举), one arm raised, one arm down (一臂抬起，一臂放下).\n手部姿态: hands clasped (双手交握), hands in pockets (手插口袋), fingers interlocked (十指交扣), hand waving (挥手), pointing finger (指向), open palm (手掌打开), fist clenched (紧握拳头), fingers gently touching thigh (手指轻触大腿).\n腿部位置: legs straight (双腿伸直), one leg bent (一腿弯曲), crossing legs (交叉双腿), knees bent (膝盖弯曲), feet together (双脚并拢), one foot forward (一脚在前).\n与环境互动 (Interaction with Environment - if applicable)：如果人物在与某个物体或环境进行互动，也需要明确描述。\nholding [object] (拿着某物), touching [surface] (触摸某物表面), sitting on [chair/ground] (坐在椅子/地上), standing next to [object] (站在某物旁边), looking at [object] (看着某物).\n行为准则 (Behavioral Rules)\n极致聚焦姿态: 【核心规则】 你的输出只包含对人物姿态的描述，不涉及服装、面部细节（除头部朝向和视线外）、场景、光线、氛围等任何其他信息。\n\n精简但详细: 在确保信息量的同时，使用最直接、最简洁的语言，避免冗余。\n\n确定性描述: 避免任何模棱两可或不确定的词语，所有描述都必须是明确的视觉状态。\n\n直接输出: 分析完成后，直接输出融合了所有分析细节的、单一的英文段落。\n\n输出示例 (Illustrative Examples)\n示例1: （您提供的参考：人物站立姿势，身体微微向左侧转动，左手自然垂落，手指轻轻触碰大腿位置，右手放置于右侧腰部，手肘稍微弯曲，呈放松状态。摄像角度为正面视角，轻微俯拍，突出人物的上半身和整体轮廓。）\n\nAI助手输出:\nStanding pose, body subtly turned left. Left arm naturally down, fingers gently touching thigh. Right hand on right hip, elbow slightly bent, relaxed. Front view, slight high angle, upper body emphasized, full silhouette visible.\n\n示例2: （图像：一位女性模特正面站立，左手叉腰，右手自然下垂，头微侧向右，双腿并拢）\n\nAI助手输出:\nStanding still, front view, head turned slightly right, gazing forward. Left hand on hip, right arm at side, legs together.\n\n示例3: （图像：一位女性模特背面行走，手臂轻微摆动，右腿在前，头回眸看向镜头）\n\nAI助手输出:\nWalking mid-stride, back view, head looking over right shoulder, gazing at viewer. Right leg forward, arms gently swinging.\n\n示例4: （图像：一位女性模特侧身坐在一张椅子上，左腿弯曲，右腿伸直，双手放在膝盖上，头略低）\n\nAI助手输出:\nSitting calmly on a chair, three-quarter side view, head looking down. Left leg bent, right leg extended straight. Hands clasped on knees.\n\n示例5: （图像：一位女性模特跳跃在空中，双臂向上伸展，双腿弯曲，身体前倾）\n\nAI助手输出:\nMid-air jump, front view, body leaning forward. Arms extended upwards, both legs bent at knees.", "proxy_hide", "authorization_hide"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 114, "type": "DeepTranslatorTextNode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui_custom_nodes_alekpet", "ver": "fb24ee9ddb2ad0e13760ee8322ed4abdc678abcd", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "DeepTranslatorTextNode"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "extra_option", "links": [174], "label": "extra_option", "type": "JoyCaption2ExtraOption", "localized_name": "extra_option"}], "size": [403.20001220703125, 466], "color": "rgba(38, 73, 116, 0.7)", "pos": [10, 770], "widgets_values": [false, false, false, true, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, true, false, false, "Huluwa"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 118, "type": "LayerUtility: JoyCaption2ExtraOptions", "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI_LayerStyle_Advance", "ver": "0f9184100e626e3202568a7cf890b3b92685a168", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LayerUtility: JoyCaption2ExtraOptions"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [143], "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [300, 120], "pos": [1740, 560], "widgets_values": ["Standing pose, body in a static state. Side view, left side. Head facing forward. Arms at side. Legs straight. Feet together. Neutral hand posture, fingers relaxed. Camera angle: front